WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.880
[ YouTube Learning ]

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:04.900
A lot of teachers have been asking me about

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:07.940
how they can start teaching their students online.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.900
So I decided to make a series of videos about

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.240
how teachers could use various tools

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:15.340
within YouTube and Google Classroom

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:18.020
to start teaching their students online.

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:19.760
I’m Ganesh; I’m the founder of Don’t Memorise

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:22.080
and in this video, I am going to teach you

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:24.540
how you could quickly create a YouTube channel.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:28.880
[ Don't Memorise intro music ]

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:31.640
I started my YouTube channel 5 years ago because

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:34.020
I wanted to educate millions of learners,

00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:36.560
and now I have a dream to educate more than

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:38.560
a billion learners in the coming years.

00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:40.660
Each one of us has this passion or

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:43.260
burning desire inside of us,

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:44.660
to share something with the world

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:48.520
and your YouTube channel will help
you do exactly that.

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:50.870
So without further ado, let’s begin!

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:53.520
The only prerequisite to starting a YouTube channel

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:56.200
is to have a Gmail ID or a Google account.

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:58.580
If you don’t have one, you can create it

00:00:58.860 --> 00:01:01.700
very easily by visiting accounts.google.com

00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:04.520
and clicking on Create Account.

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:06.140
To create your YouTube channel,

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:08.140
head over to YouTube.com,

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:09.480
and you will see the Sign In button

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:11.600
on the top right corner.

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:12.520
Click on the Sign In button

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:14.940
and enter your Google Account credentials,

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:17.560
and then you will see a page like this.

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:18.980
DO NOT get overwhelmed

00:01:18.980 --> 00:01:20.980
with all the buttons you see here.

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:24.400
You will understand everything with time.

00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:26.380
On the top right corner of the page,

00:01:26.380 --> 00:01:28.920
you will see a circle with a letter in it,

00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:31.380
and by default, it shows the first letter of the name

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:33.380
linked to your Google Account.

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:34.580
When you click on it,

00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:38.280
you will see the following options in a dropdown format.

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:42.280
Again let’s not be amazed by looking at these options.

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:43.700
Let me ask you a question here.

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:45.380
Where would you click now to

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:47.120
create your YouTube channel?

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:48.880
It’s self-explanatory right?

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:50.700
We click on ‘Create a Channel’

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:52.940
which will get us to this page!

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:55.340
Seeing this page should get you excited.

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:58.299
Your journey as a creator has begun!

00:01:58.300 --> 00:01:59.740
Once you click on ‘Get Started’,

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:01.420
you’ll see this page!

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:03.400
Now, this is asking you if you want to

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:05.400
use your Google account name

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:07.400
or think of a custom name for your channel.

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:09.680
I’d suggest you go for the custom name option,

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:12.660
which will convey what your channel means or does.

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:15.160
The custom name I gave my channel

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:16.460
was ‘Don’t Memorise’

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:18.520
because I wanted our learners to understand concepts

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:21.240
and not just memorise.

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:23.060
Once you give your channel a name,

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:25.440
you will be asked to upload a profile picture.

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:26.720
You can do that immediately

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:29.700
or even later if you wish to!

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:31.820
And that brings us to the last and

00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:33.820
one of the most important steps.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.400
The channel description.

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:38.740
This is a very important field that you need to fill in

00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:40.740
after giving it some thought.

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:42.660
This will not only help your viewers understand

00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:45.040
what your channel is all about,

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:48.430
but will also help your channel with search rankings!

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:50.040
And then you can add your relevant links,

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:52.160
and click on ‘Save and Continue’.

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:55.639
There you go; your channel is ready now!

00:02:55.640 --> 00:02:56.460
And hey, don’t worry,

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:58.560
all of these details can be changed later.

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:00.740
But hold on;

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:02.300
do you HAVE to upload videos

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:04.000
if you have a YouTube channel?

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:06.959
Or are there other advantages to it?

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:07.820
How else could we help students

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:09.820
with our YouTube channel?

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:12.040
Watch the next video to know more!

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:19.400
[ #TeachFromAnywhere ]

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:22.200
[ YouTube Learning ]

